WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.800
Welcome.

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.350
This video was rendered end to end by the
Stage E pipeline.

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:05.050
Scenes can carry imported images, charts,
numbers and text.

00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:08.100
